    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm not even living anymore. i wake up, i do the meds, the feeding, the cleaning, the waiting... and then i go to sleep just to do it all over again tomorrow. it's just this endless loop of watching someone fade away while i'm fading away too. i feel like i’m already buried under all this weight. like i’m just a ghost in this house.",
